<title>HONG KONG: Wing Lung Bank places HK$200 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Wing Lung Bank places HK$200 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wing Lung Bank has privately placed HK$200 million in floating rate certificates of deposit, Schroders Asia said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The certificates have a final maturity of five years but can be put or called on the third and fourth anniversaries.</p>
<p>Fees are 45 basis points for an all-in return of 65 basis points to participants.</p>
<p>Schroders Asia committed HK$70 million, while Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Jardine Fleming committed HK$65 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
